{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42250","headline":"和太常萧少卿近郊马上偶吟 · 徐铉","name":"和太常萧少卿近郊马上偶吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田园经雨绿分畦，飞盖闲行九里堤。\n拂袖清风尘不起，满川芳草路如迷。\n林开始觉晴天逈，潮上初惊浦岸齐。\n怪得仙郎诗句好，断霞残照远山西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}